<svg viewBox="0 0 420 440" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <!-- Tokens read by one call. Bars start at x=16. Bar length = tokens x 0.008258 px (43,592 tokens = 360px).
       Jev, 1 question 1,176 (9.71px). Jev, all 10 questions 2,669 (22.04px). Haiku, bare prompt 8,712 (71.95px).
       Luna through Codex 13,951 (115.21px). Haiku through Claude Code 43,592 (360px).
       Values sit on the label line, right-aligned to the end of the longest bar (x=376). -->
  <text class="d-t d-b" x="16" y="28">Tokens read by one call,</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="52">drawn to scale</text>

  <text class="d-t d-sm d-b" x="16" y="96">Jev, 1 question</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono d-b" x="376" y="96" text-anchor="end">1,176</text>
  <rect class="d-yellow" x="16" y="102" width="9.71" height="26" />

  <text class="d-t d-sm d-b" x="16" y="152">Jev, all 10 questions</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono d-b" x="376" y="152" text-anchor="end">2,669</text>
  <rect class="d-yellow" x="16" y="158" width="22.04" height="26" />

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="208">Haiku, bare prompt</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="376" y="208" text-anchor="end">8,712</text>
  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="214" width="71.95" height="26" />

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="264">Luna through Codex</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="376" y="264" text-anchor="end">13,951</text>
  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="270" width="115.21" height="26" />

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="320">Haiku through Claude Code</text>
  <text class="d-t d-mono" x="376" y="320" text-anchor="end">43,592</text>
  <rect class="d-box" x="16" y="326" width="360" height="26" />

  <path class="d-line" d="M16,100 L16,362" />

  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="396">Agent calls also carry their harness:</text>
  <text class="d-t d-sm" x="16" y="418">system prompt and tool list.</text>
</svg>
